dmemcg-booster (0.1.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Natalie Vock's dmemcg-booster 0.1.3 (tag 0.1.3, commit 4305d7438ca8,
    2026-08-05), the service that turns on the dmem cgroup controller in
    the cgroups systemd creates and gives app.slice the VRAM protection,
    for the TTM eviction protection Linux 7.3 merged. Debian has no
    package of it.
  * Built with Debian's Rust crates (dbus 0.9.12 for upstream's 0.9.10);
    upstream's two systemd units as they are.

